WEBVTT

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:30.920
The Scholar and the Emperor

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.280
Chief.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:41.560
Chief.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.080
They're all over there.

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.400
Chief.

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.240
Prime merchandise from every province.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:58.360
Go.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.200
These are their indenture papers.

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:05.760
There'll be no trouble afterward.

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:06.760
Send them all over.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:07.880
Yes.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.920
Chief, they're just toys.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.040
They're worthless.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:39.280
Open it.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.040
Get up.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:01.520
How old are you two?

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:02.600
Six.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:03.920
I'm five.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.120
Tell me,

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:06.680
Why did you come here?

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:10.640
-They said we'd get good food. -They said we'd get good food.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:11.560
Who said that?

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:12.920
Point him out to me, all right?

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.480
-Him. -Him.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.000
Me?

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.120
Chief, it wasn't me!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.360
I knew nothing about this. I didn't know there were children.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.320
I'll take you somewhere nice.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:28.640
There's lots of delicious food there.

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:30.080
Would you like that?

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.080
-Yes. -Yes.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:32.880
Good girls.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:36.760
Come on.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:38.280
Careful.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:45.440
Chief!

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:46.760
I truly didn't know there were children inside.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.200
I didn't know anything.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.480
He was in charge of all this.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:50.400
It was him.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.320
It was him!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:52.800
-It wasn't me! -Chief, spare me!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.080
I wouldn't dare, not even with all the nerve in the world.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:58.080
Chief, this truly had nothing to do with me.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.440
Chief, this wasn't my fault. I truly knew nothing.

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:01.360
Chief!

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.000
Please spare me, Chief!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.640
Chief!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.800
Didn't I tell you

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.320
We may sell anything but children?

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:10.800
You did.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:12.280
Chief!

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:13.640
This truly had nothing to do with me.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.560
Chief, please spare my life!

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:29.040
There won't be a next time.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:42.440
Big Brother.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.360
Thank goodness.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.600
How many times did I warn you?

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.440
The Chief has no tolerance for this.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:49.560
He repeatedly forbade us to touch children.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.000
I was wrong. I lost my head.

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:52.560
Children have been fetching high prices lately.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.240
I'll never do it again.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.760
You think the Chief doesn't know who did it?

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.240
Little brother,

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.800
You heard him just now.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:04.520
The Chief said

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.360
This is your last chance.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:08.480
Understood.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:10.760
Big Brother,

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:11.840
I can redeem myself.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.720
I've found out who wiped out

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:16.520
Our Shazhou branch.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:19.160
-Are you certain? -Absolutely.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.200
After extensive investigation,

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:30.560
The pattern on this arrow resembles a flower called Xiyan.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:33.800
It grows in the miasma forest between Beijian and former Zhongwan,

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:35.160
Nourished by the poisonous vapors.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:36.840
It blooms at night, withers by day, and feeds on living creatures.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.000
It also symbolizes hatred and revenge.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.840
Anyone using this flower as an emblem

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:42.800
Cannot be an innocent buyer.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:44.920
Could it be Beijian?

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.040
Beijian may lack iron ore

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.160
And have inferior weapons, but its warhorses are excellent.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.800
It has also expanded its cavalry in recent years.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:52.880
We must remain on guard.

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:54.480
Zhongwan is even less likely.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.000
Zhongwan submitted to Great Ning long ago,

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.240
And there has been peace for years.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.120
When Zhongwan fell,

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.640
Its people were exiled across the realm

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:01.720
And enslaved for generations.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.440
But one branch of the Zhongwan royal family

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.080
Escaped with its remaining forces.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.840
Their whereabouts remain unknown.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:08.640
This must be investigated thoroughly.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:10.200
Your Majesty,

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.880
This is like searching for a needle in the ocean.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.320
And because it involves state secrets,

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.720
I can only investigate covertly.

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:17.320
That makes it even harder.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.840
In that case,

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:21.560
I'll grant you an official post.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.720
It will let you investigate discreetly,

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.800
Inspect the capital's merchants,

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.160
And review commercial taxes across the provinces.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.520
You shall be Commissioner of Folkways.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.560
Commissioner of Folkways?

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:33.880
Why does that title sound

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.160
A little improper?

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.280
What?

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:37.400
Is the title unworthy

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.240
Of Lord Shen's refined reputation?

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.360
Your Majesty's word is law.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.280
Of course it's worthy.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.440
Then let me take Your Majesty to Changle Street to sample the local color.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:45.840
Commissioner of Folkways...

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.160
The palace is full of the Left Chancellor's spies.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.800
The shadow guards just sent word.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.760
The Left Chancellor has people spreading rumors through the city

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.200
That this special examination is nothing but a ruse.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:55.080
Once the results are announced,

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:57.360
The talented women will be sent to the Imperial Entertainment Bureau.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:58.760
He's endured it for three months,

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.520
Yet the Left Chancellor still hasn't swallowed his anger over the Ministry of War.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.240
Now he merely wants to humiliate me through the special examination.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.120
By spreading these rumors,

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.280
He assumes

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:09.680
Women are timid

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:10.920
And cannot weather a storm.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:13.640
Some candidates have indeed withdrawn and returned home.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.480
Your Majesty, will you simply let these rumors run rampant?

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:17.720
An official

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.240
Must possess courage and wisdom.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.040
If they abandon the examination today

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.160
And return home because of rumors,

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:25.720
How could they ever withstand

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.200
The open attacks and hidden schemes of the royal court?

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:30.640
I should thank the Left Chancellor

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.320
For sparing me the palace examination.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:35.280
Your Majesty.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:40.920
Your Majesty, I have a report.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.640
By order of the Left Chancellor,

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.240
I respectfully present this plaque.

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:50.960
The ancestral law of Great Ning:

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:53.600
A romance between sovereign and minister shakes the foundations of the state.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:54.560
All nine clans shall be executed.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.080
As I recall, Emperor Taizong

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:58.040
Had an affair with a female attendant,

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.040
Which sparked mutinies in two provinces.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.480
That is why this ancestral law was written.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.920
The Left Chancellor is implying

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.960
That Your Majesty reopened the women's examination for personal romance.

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.400
The Left Chancellor ordered me

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.480
To hang this plaque in the center of the imperial study.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:11.760
Should Your Majesty refuse,

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.800
He will come petition you himself.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.240
Insolence!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:16.400
Huo An,

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.560
How dare you speak so brazenly?

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:18.680
Huang Bo.

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:24.400
General Huo, hang it up.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.000
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:32.640
First he spread rumors

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:33.800
To frighten away the female candidates.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.440
Now he invokes ancestral law.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.440
The Left Chancellor has made two moves in succession.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.680
It seems he can no longer wait.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.360
That stubborn old man is unbelievably petty.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.400
Your Majesty sent him a plaque bearing Ding Chong's name,

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.720
So he returns the favor with an ancestral-law plaque.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.280
I have no such intentions.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:51.080
Even if every hall were covered with ancestral laws, why should I fear?

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:53.160
I mean to tell every official plainly:

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:56.600
Women, too, can be blades that serve the nation.

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.560
This court

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:01.400
Has never belonged to the Left Chancellor alone.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:03.040
I support Your Majesty.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:04.600
The women sitting the special examination

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:05.800
Are all staying on Changle Street.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:08.000
Your Majesty should inspect the talent for yourself.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:10.400
You might even happen upon

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.240
Provincial Laureate Meng from Shazhou.

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:13.640
The Left Chancellor sent that plaque

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:14.880
To warn you

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.480
To show restraint.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:17.400
Me?

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:18.520
Exactly.

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:19.920
Your Majesty isn't going anywhere.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:20.880
Why not?

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:23.720
We're going.

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:32.680
A thousand night-market lamps illuminate the clouds;

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:35.360
Red sleeves fill the lofty towers.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.080
Who knew beyond the palace walls

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.080
The mortal world could be so splendid?

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:41.880
This flourishing age of Great Ning

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:42.960
Is exactly what Your Majesty wished for.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:46.680
The beauties of Changle Street are truly each unique.

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:48.920
The lady on the left has sparkling eyes;

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:51.720
The beauty on the right has ruby lips and pearly teeth.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:54.440
Marvelous.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.520
Changle Street at night

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:01.960
Is even more dazzling than by day.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.040
This glittering, decadent Changle Street

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:06.920
Is filled with handsome young men.

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.240
I absolutely love it.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:09.840
Yan Fuzhi.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.200
Mengmeng, all this walking has made me hungry.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.280
A waiter told me today

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.360
That Chunman Inn serves mutton noodles too.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.440
Let's see how they compare to the noodles back in Shazhou.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:21.440
Come on.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.360
Places of wealth and pleasure

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.200
Often breed the ugliest things beneath.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.400
Young Master He,

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.640
This isn't Shazhou.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:32.320
We're right beneath the Emperor's feet.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.000
Who would dare cause trouble here?

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.280
Let us hope this prosperity

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:37.840
Isn't merely gilded on the outside

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.240
And rotten within.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.240
Young Master He never stops worrying about the country and its people.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.240
Cousin, we've been walking for ages.

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:46.640
My stomach is protesting.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.320
Let's get something to eat

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.480
At Changle Street's famous Chunman Inn.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.720
Provincial Laureate Meng, you're back!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.040
Manager, two bowls of mutton noodles. We're starving.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.200
Coming right up.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.440
Perfect. There's a good table here. Sit down.

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:02.520
Young Master He is here.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.200
Welcome.

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.760
The usual today?

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.320
The usual. Bring it out.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:10.560
Certainly.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.560
This way, honored guests.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:19.560
Mengmeng, what are you looking at?

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.120
Nothing.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:27.440
Apricot blossoms.

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:34.760
Mengmeng,

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:37.320
You know Shazhou has nothing

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.160
But poplars and yellow sand.

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.400
Where would we ever see flowers this beautiful?

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.280
Bring us every house specialty.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.160
-And a flask of Shaosanbai. -Certainly.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:06.240
Wait.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.880
You know Young Master never drinks.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:09.680
You're the one craving wine, aren't you?

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:12.040
As if you aren't always the fiercest drinker.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.520
Lord Shen usually spends next month's salary today.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.240
Why so generous all of a sudden?

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:18.520
Cousin,

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.560
I rendered great service in Shazhou.

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.000
Surely treating a meritorious official to a meal isn't excessive?

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:23.040
Wouldn't you agree?

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.920
I knew bringing Young Master out to gather local color

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.240
Wasn't that simple.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.360
Three bowls of mutton noodles.

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:29.720
Certainly.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.320
Three bowls of mutton noodles.

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:32.240
Cousin,

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:34.520
Is that truly all we're having?

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:35.560
Why?

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:36.840
There's meat, noodles,

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:38.320
And vegetables.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:39.760
What more could Lord Shen want?

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:42.040
Were you hoping to use Young Master's generosity

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.320
To impress all those ladies?

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:46.880
What ladies?

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:49.160
Mutton noodles simply remind me

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.000
Of that fierce proprietress in Shazhou.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:54.000
What a terrifying woman.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:58.000
Enjoy.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:10.360
This broth is so bland,

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.600
And the mutton is limp and flavorless.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:15.760
Mengmeng, once you become the top scholar in the capital,

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:17.280
I'll open a Bofeng House here and stay with you.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.080
Then Chunman Inn's signboard

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.400
Can be chopped up for firewood.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:28.880
Fuzhi,

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.000
The capital is filled with talent.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.640
I don't even know whether I'll pass the metropolitan exam.

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:34.960
How could I speak of placing first?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:35.880
Mengmeng,

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.520
I heard today

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:40.080
That all women taking this exam will be sent to the Entertainment Bureau.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:42.040
Many have withdrawn because of it.

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:43.440
I'm worried about you.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.560
Why heed such absurd rumors?

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.760
How do you know they're false?

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.120
His Majesty reopened

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:53.760
This special examination despite opposition from every side.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:55.880
This rumor

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.320
Must be the work of powerful officials

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:58.560
Who oppose women entering the civil service

00:13:58.640 --> 00:13:59.680
And are scheming in secret.

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:01.040
They hope the rumors

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.640
Will scare timid candidates away.

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:04.480
Those shameless villains

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:05.520
Have no respect for the law.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:12.920
Eat your noodles.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.360
Ever since returning from Shazhou,

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:18.040
Young Master has kept mentioning mutton noodles.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.080
The first taste must always be the broth.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.240
It isn't as good as Shazhou's.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:05.520
-Mengmeng, over here! -Fuzhi!

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:09.840
Give it to me. I'll carry it.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:11.760
How was it? Was the exam difficult?

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.040
No.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.440
-Did you do well? -Yes.

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:16.400
I knew a little metropolitan exam could never defeat you.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.040
Fellow candidate,

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.040
You dropped your ink stick.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:23.640
Thank you.

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:31.360
Mengmeng,

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:32.400
She's beautiful.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:35.040
The examination hall is full of hidden dragons and crouching tigers.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.240
She must be no ordinary young lady.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.520
Let's go.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.720
I specially drew this most auspicious lot for you at Lingquan Temple.

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:45.000
The monk who interpreted it said your name will surely grace the honor roll.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.240
Mengmeng, what are you searching for?

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:15.560
Nothing.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.280
Perhaps I was mistaken.

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:19.000
Are you exhausted?

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:21.360
I reserved a table for you at Chunman Inn

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:22.520
With especially nourishing dishes

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:23.520
To restore your strength.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:24.840
Let's go.

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:27.320
This way.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:33.080
He's so handsome.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.560
Dear sister, did you miss me these past three days?

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:44.720
I haven't seen you for a few days,

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.040
And you've already lost weight.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:47.720
Why are you here all of a sudden?

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.040
Did you cause trouble again and come use me as a shield?

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:51.920
What a thing to say.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.200
As your loving brother,

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.680
Of course I worry about you.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:55.960
I even set aside my official duties to come here.

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:59.480
You could have entered office through family privilege, just as I did.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:01.320
Why insist on taking this special examination?

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:04.840
You never flatter me without a reason.

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:06.560
Fine.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.040
Father sent me to fetch you.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.280
A-Nian insisted on coming too,

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:10.720
But official business suddenly detained him.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.000
I knew it.

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:13.360
Why else would our esteemed Lord Shen

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.960
Suddenly care so much about my affairs?

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:18.680
Father told me to hurry you home to celebrate.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.160
He even brought out his treasured wine.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.040
But something is strange.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:23.880
How did Father know I'd definitely pass?

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:26.320
-You don't believe in me? -Of course I do.

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:27.920
My sister could recite the Analects at three

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.320
And understood the Songs of Chu at seven.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.680
Everyone in the capital knows

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:32.280
The name of the great scholar Shen.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.200
Besides,

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:35.520
Just look whose sister you are.

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:39.640
Slow down. Don't bump into anyone.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.760
Left Chancellor.

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.360
The metropolitan examination is over.

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.240
All candidates have left the compound.

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.560
Here are the sealed examination papers.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:12.880
The results will be posted tomorrow.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.320
Today I'll release a sky lantern for you

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:15.280
To welcome good fortune.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.600
May my pen carry me into public service,

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:18.480
Change my destiny,

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:24.000
And protect those dearest to me.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.200
It will.

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.240
Once you pass,

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:28.200
I'll open an even bigger Bofeng House in the capital.

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:29.400
We'll stay here together.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:32.040
-We'll stay in the capital together. -Stay in the capital.

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.800
May Mengmeng's name grace the honor roll.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:38.360
May Bofeng House spread across Great Ning.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:07.920
I passed!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.080
I passed!

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:12.560
Excuse us. Let us through.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.200
Please let us through. Excuse us.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.280
I passed!

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:20.560
I passed too!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.480
I passed!

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:25.360
Why isn't your name there?

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:26.680
Keep looking.

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:28.600
That's me. Right there.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:29.840
Here.

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:30.760
I'm here.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.680
Why can't we find it?

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.600
Could there be a mistake?

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.040
Mengmeng.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:25.600
Let me through.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:26.960
Mengmeng!

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:28.160
Mengmeng!

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:29.920
Mengmeng!

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:32.960
Could there be a mistake?

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:39.560
The papers were reviewed jointly

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:41.360
By officials from the Ministry of Rites and the Hanlin Academy.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:43.640
There can't be a mistake.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.080
I'll check again.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:46.320
Fuzhi.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:48.280
Don't.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.240
I'm suddenly hungry.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:56.560
Let's eat.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:17.120
Do the officials in this capital look down on everyone?

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:19.280
Your essay wasn't selected?

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.680
They must all be blind.

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:25.160
The capital is crowded with prying ears.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.280
Don't speak in anger.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:33.160
Great Ning's seven provinces are filled with talent.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:34.400
Even a Provincial Laureate

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.360
Isn't guaranteed to become a Metropolitan Graduate.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:39.040
The capital isn't so wonderful anyway.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.120
It can't even serve a decent bowl of mutton noodles.

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.600
Shazhou is thriving now.

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:45.600
You're a Provincial Laureate.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:46.680
Even if you return to Shazhou,

00:21:46.760 --> 00:21:48.200
You could secure an official post.

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:49.880
Let's go back together.

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:51.760
Government vacancies

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.800
Don't appear every year.

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:56.680
What use is my Provincial Laureate title?

00:21:57.360 --> 00:21:59.160
Don't speak of yourself that way.

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:01.200
Master Zhuge was twenty-seven when he entered public life.

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:03.600
Jiang Taigong was seventy-two when his talents were recognized.

00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:04.520
Three years from now,

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:06.000
I'll come with you to take the exam again.

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:08.360
Mengmeng, you can do it.

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:14.760
I've walked this path for ten years.

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.000
I worked for ten years,

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:22.640
But I still didn't reach the end.

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:28.960
I tried so hard.

00:22:31.440 --> 00:22:33.160
I truly tried.

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:36.440
Mengmeng.

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:37.960
I know.

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:39.600
I saw everything.

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:42.360
Even if you never pass,

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:45.280
You are still the finest Meng Tinghui in the whole world.

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:47.480
You are the one and only Meng Tinghui.

00:22:57.400 --> 00:22:59.000
The loyal and upright remain silent,

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:00.560
While the wicked and flattering advance by the day.

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:01.800
When faults go unseen,

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:03.240
Ruin inevitably follows.

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:06.360
This essay is incisive.

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:08.000
Every word strikes at the abuses of our time,

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:10.000
Yet it also carries a desire for reform.

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:12.200
More remarkably,

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:14.920
It is bold without overstepping.

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:16.800
To use women to break the impasse...

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:18.680
Such a startling argument

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:21.800
Does sound exactly like her.

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:22.760
Huang Bo.

00:23:23.120 --> 00:23:24.080
Who is this year's Metropolitan Laureate?

00:23:24.160 --> 00:23:25.000
Your Majesty,

00:23:25.080 --> 00:23:26.920
It is a woman of the An family from Qingzhou,

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:28.000
Named Rulan.

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:37.320
And Meng Tinghui?

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:38.880
Where did she place?

00:23:39.400 --> 00:23:40.640
Provincial Laureate Meng...

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:42.880
Failed.

00:23:48.240 --> 00:23:49.880
The realm is vast,

00:23:49.960 --> 00:23:51.680
So an abundance of talented scholars is only natural.

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:56.120
But the brushwork and arguments

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:57.520
Are identical.

00:23:57.880 --> 00:23:59.320
How could that be coincidence?

00:24:15.360 --> 00:24:18.080
That fortune from Lingquan Temple was worthless.

00:24:20.400 --> 00:24:22.440
Shazhou's Great Buddha Temple is far better.

00:24:59.120 --> 00:24:59.960
Mengmeng.

00:25:00.040 --> 00:25:02.640
I brought your favorite fruit and apricot-skin cakes.

00:25:06.720 --> 00:25:08.400
Why is it so dark? Why didn't you light a lamp?

00:25:22.000 --> 00:25:24.600
Mengmeng?

00:25:26.040 --> 00:25:27.000
Mengmeng!

00:25:28.320 --> 00:25:29.400
Mengmeng!

00:25:33.160 --> 00:25:34.040
What's wrong?

00:25:36.760 --> 00:25:37.600
Mengmeng!

00:25:38.080 --> 00:25:40.080
Get a physician! Quickly!

00:25:40.320 --> 00:25:41.960
Shunzi!

00:25:42.520 --> 00:25:43.360
Mengmeng!

00:25:44.240 --> 00:25:45.760
Mengmeng!

00:25:48.760 --> 00:25:50.840
Wake up, Mengmeng!

00:26:24.080 --> 00:26:24.920
Mengmeng!

00:26:26.400 --> 00:26:27.480
You're awake.

00:26:28.840 --> 00:26:30.400
How could you be so cruel?

00:26:30.480 --> 00:26:32.640
We agreed to return to Shazhou together.

00:26:32.720 --> 00:26:34.200
You broke your promise

00:26:34.280 --> 00:26:36.160
And tried to take your own life.

00:26:36.440 --> 00:26:37.280
The physician said

00:26:37.360 --> 00:26:39.040
That if we'd been one step later,

00:26:39.120 --> 00:26:40.640
Not even an immortal could have saved you.

00:26:40.720 --> 00:26:41.880
You only failed an examination.

00:26:41.960 --> 00:26:43.360
How could you be so foolish?

00:26:44.440 --> 00:26:45.280
Slowly.

00:26:49.800 --> 00:26:51.160
Someone tried to kill me.

00:26:51.720 --> 00:26:53.120
Someone tried to kill you?

00:26:54.440 --> 00:26:56.000
Who? Did you see them clearly?

00:26:56.960 --> 00:26:58.080
It was too dark.

00:26:58.720 --> 00:26:59.680
I couldn't see.

00:27:01.240 --> 00:27:02.720
But the person was very strong.

00:27:03.280 --> 00:27:05.040
They could have killed me outright,

00:27:05.560 --> 00:27:07.480
Yet they staged it as a suicide.

00:27:08.240 --> 00:27:09.320
They wanted me dead

00:27:09.960 --> 00:27:11.040
Without prompting an investigation.

00:27:13.280 --> 00:27:14.360
Fuzhi,

00:27:14.440 --> 00:27:15.920
I must be standing in someone's way.

00:27:17.280 --> 00:27:19.200
There must be more to my failed result.

00:27:19.760 --> 00:27:21.080
Those damned bastards!

00:27:21.400 --> 00:27:22.720
We'll catch them

00:27:22.880 --> 00:27:24.760
And hang them from a beam for three days of beating.

00:27:26.080 --> 00:27:26.920
But

00:27:27.280 --> 00:27:28.680
We've only just arrived in the capital

00:27:28.840 --> 00:27:30.160
And haven't offended anyone.

00:27:30.720 --> 00:27:32.120
Who would do such a thing?

00:27:35.440 --> 00:27:37.520
Once they learn I'm still alive,

00:27:38.400 --> 00:27:39.640
They won't let me go.

00:27:42.600 --> 00:27:43.520
We should leave first

00:27:43.600 --> 00:27:44.440
And think of a plan afterward.

00:27:44.520 --> 00:27:46.320
All right. I'll pack our things.

00:27:46.880 --> 00:27:48.360
Forget it. Staying alive matters more.

00:27:48.440 --> 00:27:49.480
We're leaving now.

00:27:54.280 --> 00:27:55.640
-Let's go. -Careful.

00:27:56.320 --> 00:27:58.600
His Majesty attaches great importance to this women's examination.

00:27:59.120 --> 00:28:01.000
He was especially moved by An Rulan's policy essay

00:28:01.080 --> 00:28:02.320
And personally named her Metropolitan Laureate.

00:28:02.920 --> 00:28:04.320
He even ordered copies circulated throughout the provinces

00:28:04.400 --> 00:28:05.360
For scholars to study.

00:28:05.840 --> 00:28:06.840
Look.

00:28:06.920 --> 00:28:08.240
This is my favorite passage:

00:28:08.880 --> 00:28:10.080
'The loyal and upright remain silent,

00:28:10.160 --> 00:28:11.560
While the wicked and flattering advance by the day.

00:28:11.800 --> 00:28:12.760
When faults go unseen,

00:28:13.320 --> 00:28:14.960
Ruin inevitably follows.'

00:28:15.280 --> 00:28:17.160
With writing and conviction like this,

00:28:17.240 --> 00:28:18.640
No wonder she became Metropolitan Laureate.

00:28:18.720 --> 00:28:20.880
-Exactly. -Yes, it's brilliantly written.

00:28:20.960 --> 00:28:22.040
Mengmeng.

00:28:23.960 --> 00:28:25.560
How can a scholar be so rude?

00:28:28.320 --> 00:28:29.320
This is my policy essay.

00:28:30.560 --> 00:28:31.520
You failed the metropolitan exam.

00:28:31.600 --> 00:28:32.880
How dare you claim this essay is yours?

00:28:32.960 --> 00:28:34.240
Have you lost your mind from disappointment?

00:28:34.320 --> 00:28:36.000
-You! -You tried to hang yourself last night,

00:28:36.080 --> 00:28:37.320
And now you're spouting such madness.

00:28:37.640 --> 00:28:39.280
You need your head examined.

00:28:39.360 --> 00:28:40.200
Miss Meng,

00:28:40.280 --> 00:28:41.680
Our dynasty strictly forbids examination fraud.

00:28:41.760 --> 00:28:42.800
Such a thing couldn't possibly happen.

00:28:43.360 --> 00:28:44.680
If Mengmeng says it's hers, then it is.

00:28:45.240 --> 00:28:47.160
The claim that she hanged herself is absurd.

00:28:47.240 --> 00:28:48.920
Spread that rumor again

00:28:49.000 --> 00:28:50.240
And I'll tear your mouths apart.

00:28:50.600 --> 00:28:51.720
Mengmeng, let's go.

00:28:52.440 --> 00:28:53.480
You...

00:28:57.840 --> 00:28:59.920
Mengmeng, I knew you had passed.

00:29:00.160 --> 00:29:01.160
That An Rulan

00:29:01.240 --> 00:29:02.800
Actually stole your policy essay.

00:29:02.880 --> 00:29:04.440
Let's report her to the authorities now

00:29:04.520 --> 00:29:05.680
And reclaim your title as Metropolitan Laureate.

00:29:07.520 --> 00:29:08.560
It isn't that simple.

00:29:09.720 --> 00:29:10.600
These waters

00:29:11.160 --> 00:29:12.640
Run deeper than either of us imagined.

00:29:13.680 --> 00:29:15.040
The Ministry of Rites oversees the examination.

00:29:15.680 --> 00:29:17.520
Without help from officials inside,

00:29:17.880 --> 00:29:19.480
How would An Rulan dare steal my essay?

00:29:20.160 --> 00:29:21.440
If we report it now,

00:29:21.840 --> 00:29:23.200
We may be walking into a trap.

00:29:24.960 --> 00:29:27.000
This capital devours people even more viciously than Shazhou.

00:29:27.840 --> 00:29:29.200
You nearly died once already.

00:29:30.080 --> 00:29:31.160
I'm scared.

00:29:31.960 --> 00:29:33.040
I'm taking you back to Shazhou.

00:29:33.120 --> 00:29:34.640
But I did pass.

00:29:35.520 --> 00:29:36.760
I was the Metropolitan Laureate, Fuzhi.

00:29:38.920 --> 00:29:40.920
I can't pretend none of this happened.

00:29:41.880 --> 00:29:43.640
I've walked this path for ten years.

00:29:44.640 --> 00:29:46.040
I can't simply give it up now.

00:29:47.120 --> 00:29:47.960
I won't accept that.

00:29:51.280 --> 00:29:52.240
Fine.

00:29:52.320 --> 00:29:53.280
Then we won't leave.

00:29:53.360 --> 00:29:54.320
I'll stay with you.

00:29:54.880 --> 00:29:55.880
Even if we face mountains of blades and seas of fire,

00:29:55.960 --> 00:29:57.360
I'll face them with you.

00:29:59.400 --> 00:30:00.480
But

00:30:01.000 --> 00:30:02.800
We know no one in the capital.

00:30:03.880 --> 00:30:04.720
Young Master He

00:30:04.800 --> 00:30:05.640
And Lord Shen

00:30:05.720 --> 00:30:07.160
Are in the capital, aren't they?

00:30:07.400 --> 00:30:08.720
Can we ask them for help?

00:30:11.160 --> 00:30:13.160
We still know too little.

00:30:13.960 --> 00:30:15.760
Seeking them out rashly may accomplish nothing.

00:30:17.040 --> 00:30:18.480
Then what do we do?

00:30:19.080 --> 00:30:20.280
They wanted to silence me

00:30:21.080 --> 00:30:22.600
Without drawing attention.

00:30:23.240 --> 00:30:24.280
In that case,

00:30:24.800 --> 00:30:26.440
We'll make the whole city talk about it.

00:30:27.320 --> 00:30:28.760
Then when we report it,

00:30:29.040 --> 00:30:30.520
The authorities will think twice before protecting them.

00:30:32.760 --> 00:30:34.240
His Majesty has arrived.

00:30:38.480 --> 00:30:40.560
Your servant Zhang Mingshan welcomes Your Majesty.

00:30:40.640 --> 00:30:42.200
Rise, my ministers.

00:30:42.280 --> 00:30:43.880
-Thank you, Your Majesty. -Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:30:47.000 --> 00:30:48.000
Minister Zhang,

00:30:48.560 --> 00:30:50.440
I cast a divination this morning.

00:30:51.000 --> 00:30:52.040
The signs said

00:30:52.600 --> 00:30:53.760
Among the rejected examination papers

00:30:53.840 --> 00:30:55.040
Lies a brilliant pearl.

00:30:55.680 --> 00:30:57.720
Surely no one was blind enough

00:30:57.800 --> 00:31:00.120
To mistake a luminous pearl for a fish eye and throw it away?

00:31:00.200 --> 00:31:01.560
Your Majesty is joking.

00:31:01.720 --> 00:31:04.720
We review papers with utmost rigor. How could we...

00:31:06.640 --> 00:31:09.000
I merely made an offhand remark.

00:31:09.080 --> 00:31:10.800
Why are you so frightened?

00:31:11.680 --> 00:31:12.600
Huang Bo,

00:31:14.160 --> 00:31:16.000
Does Minister Zhang's reaction

00:31:16.080 --> 00:31:17.240
Look like

00:31:18.560 --> 00:31:19.640
A guilty conscience?

00:31:19.720 --> 00:31:20.920
It does.

00:31:22.120 --> 00:31:23.640
I beg permission to speak frankly.

00:31:24.200 --> 00:31:25.200
Rumors have circulated lately

00:31:25.760 --> 00:31:26.960
That a failed candidate,

00:31:27.040 --> 00:31:27.920
Bitter over her result,

00:31:28.040 --> 00:31:29.400
Deliberately spread false claims.

00:31:29.600 --> 00:31:32.120
I fear someone is deceiving Your Majesty

00:31:32.240 --> 00:31:33.760
And disrupting the court's great task of selecting talent.

00:31:33.840 --> 00:31:36.240
Then let us make a wager.

00:31:37.200 --> 00:31:38.560
If I find a pearl

00:31:38.640 --> 00:31:39.480
Among these rejected papers,

00:31:41.280 --> 00:31:42.640
May I borrow your head

00:31:43.520 --> 00:31:45.960
And use it as a cuju ball?

00:31:46.960 --> 00:31:48.960
Your Majesty has countless affairs of state.

00:31:49.160 --> 00:31:50.560
We have already removed

00:31:50.800 --> 00:31:52.440
The mediocre essays on your behalf.

00:31:53.000 --> 00:31:54.160
Why not let me present

00:31:54.240 --> 00:31:56.600
The finest essays from those selected?

00:31:56.680 --> 00:31:59.400
You may review them over tea.

00:32:01.760 --> 00:32:02.920
What are you waiting for?

00:32:03.400 --> 00:32:04.600
Bring the rejected papers.

00:32:04.680 --> 00:32:05.520
Yes.

00:32:06.200 --> 00:32:07.040
Zheng Ru.

00:32:25.160 --> 00:32:26.440
According to this article,

00:32:26.560 --> 00:32:27.760
The Metropolitan Laureate's essay was fraudulent.

00:32:27.840 --> 00:32:28.800
Could the names of other candidates

00:32:28.880 --> 00:32:30.320
Also have been stolen?

00:32:30.560 --> 00:32:33.320
Exactly. As the article says,

00:32:33.640 --> 00:32:36.080
Every candidate's examination paper should be made public.

00:32:36.360 --> 00:32:37.800
-Shouldn't they? -Yes!

00:32:37.880 --> 00:32:39.920
-Release them! -Release the papers!

00:32:40.000 --> 00:32:43.240
-Release the papers! No more cover-ups! -Release them!

00:32:43.320 --> 00:32:44.240
Release the papers!

00:32:45.400 --> 00:32:46.240
What are you doing?

00:32:47.520 --> 00:32:49.360
-Don't read that. Hand it over! -Who are these people?

00:32:49.920 --> 00:32:51.640
Why are they acting exactly like Shazhou's Black Tiger Hall?

00:32:52.200 --> 00:32:53.960
They must be the people who tried to kill me.

00:32:54.040 --> 00:32:55.360
They failed last night.

00:32:55.800 --> 00:32:57.080
Now that the matter has grown,

00:32:57.840 --> 00:32:58.920
They won't let me go.

00:32:59.000 --> 00:33:01.160
Even in the capital, lawless villains

00:33:01.400 --> 00:33:02.760
Dare attack openly.

00:33:05.960 --> 00:33:07.360
-Seize them! -They're after me.

00:33:08.080 --> 00:33:08.960
We'll split up.

00:33:09.440 --> 00:33:11.280
Go to the Shen residence and find Lord Shen. He may be our only hope.

00:33:11.840 --> 00:33:13.480
I'll make a public procession to the Capital Prefecture.

00:33:13.560 --> 00:33:15.800
With so many witnesses, the authorities won't dare show favoritism.

00:33:15.880 --> 00:33:16.960
Go!

00:33:21.960 --> 00:33:22.800
Chancellor.

00:33:24.120 --> 00:33:25.080
Chancellor.

00:33:25.720 --> 00:33:26.680
Someone has written an article

00:33:26.760 --> 00:33:28.240
Claiming the Metropolitan Laureate's essay

00:33:28.320 --> 00:33:29.600
Was submitted under a false name.

00:33:29.760 --> 00:33:31.840
The whole city is talking about it.

00:33:31.920 --> 00:33:33.840
Examination fraud is a matter for the Ministry of Rites.

00:33:34.680 --> 00:33:36.160
The greater the uproar, the better.

00:33:37.120 --> 00:33:38.680
We shall watch from the sidelines

00:33:39.400 --> 00:33:40.800
And enjoy the spectacle.

00:33:42.280 --> 00:33:43.360
Meng Tinghui.

00:33:44.840 --> 00:33:46.160
Have you investigated her?

00:33:49.000 --> 00:33:49.920
Left Chancellor,

00:33:50.200 --> 00:33:51.760
She is the common woman from Shazhou

00:33:51.840 --> 00:33:53.640
Who helped His Majesty escape.

00:33:54.200 --> 00:33:56.040
She is skilled in underworld tricks

00:33:56.240 --> 00:33:57.520
And acts unpredictably.

00:33:57.600 --> 00:33:58.680
She is impossible to guard against.

00:33:58.760 --> 00:34:00.440
Had she not interfered,

00:34:01.080 --> 00:34:02.800
I would have brought His Majesty back long ago.

00:34:03.520 --> 00:34:05.760
No wonder His Majesty has behaved

00:34:05.840 --> 00:34:08.440
With increasing recklessness since returning from Shazhou.

00:34:09.000 --> 00:34:10.360
So his judgment was bewitched

00:34:10.440 --> 00:34:12.680
By such a lowborn temptress.

00:34:13.280 --> 00:34:14.760
A mere insect

00:34:15.760 --> 00:34:18.000
Dares meddle in court affairs.

00:34:18.080 --> 00:34:19.720
That woman cannot be allowed to live.

00:34:25.200 --> 00:34:26.320
Seen this way,

00:34:28.200 --> 00:34:29.440
A little disorder

00:34:29.520 --> 00:34:31.600
May not be a bad thing.

00:34:32.160 --> 00:34:33.840
Meng Tinghui scattered printed copies of the article

00:34:33.920 --> 00:34:35.000
Throughout the capital.

00:34:35.080 --> 00:34:36.400
Vice Minister Zhang had full authority

00:34:36.480 --> 00:34:38.280
Over the metropolitan examination,

00:34:38.840 --> 00:34:40.440
But it remains the Ministry of Rites' responsibility.

00:34:41.000 --> 00:34:42.560
What if you are implicated?

00:34:43.360 --> 00:34:46.640
Why panic? I warned His Majesty long ago

00:34:46.920 --> 00:34:48.080
That a women's special examination

00:34:48.320 --> 00:34:49.600
Was utterly absurd.

00:34:50.760 --> 00:34:52.880
Yet His Majesty insisted.

00:34:52.960 --> 00:34:54.520
And now

00:34:55.040 --> 00:34:56.200
Meng Tinghui has caused

00:34:56.280 --> 00:34:59.240
A scandal that makes the realm laugh.

00:34:59.320 --> 00:35:00.840
The one who should be worried now

00:35:01.040 --> 00:35:02.680
Is His Majesty.

00:35:03.240 --> 00:35:05.440
I hear His Majesty has already gone to the examination compound.

00:35:06.120 --> 00:35:07.880
The sovereign of the realm

00:35:07.960 --> 00:35:09.920
Left the palace for a temptress.

00:35:10.360 --> 00:35:12.520
He is utterly bewitched,

00:35:12.840 --> 00:35:14.320
Foolish beyond measure.

00:35:14.880 --> 00:35:16.040
In that case,

00:35:16.920 --> 00:35:19.600
I will ensure this women's examination

00:35:20.040 --> 00:35:22.360
Cannot continue.

00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:23.760
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

00:35:23.880 --> 00:35:24.760
I deserve death.

00:35:25.120 --> 00:35:26.520
I was careless just now

00:35:26.600 --> 00:35:27.600
And dropped them into a water vat.

00:35:28.080 --> 00:35:29.640
I tried with all my strength to save them,

00:35:30.040 --> 00:35:30.960
But the examination papers...

00:35:32.800 --> 00:35:34.080
Were you injured, Minister?

00:35:34.640 --> 00:35:36.560
Shall I summon an imperial physician at once?

00:35:36.720 --> 00:35:38.240
Thank you for your concern, Your Majesty.

00:35:38.880 --> 00:35:40.400
I am unharmed.

00:35:41.080 --> 00:35:42.200
Since you're unharmed,

00:35:42.720 --> 00:35:43.920
Vice Minister Zheng, please fetch

00:35:44.000 --> 00:35:46.280
The transcribed copies.

00:35:47.560 --> 00:35:48.400
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

00:35:49.040 --> 00:35:50.320
A swarm of rats entered

00:35:50.400 --> 00:35:51.240
The compound's side rooms last night.

00:35:51.920 --> 00:35:56.160
Those wretched rats devoured all the copied papers.

00:35:57.640 --> 00:35:59.280
Those wretched rats

00:36:00.240 --> 00:36:02.760
Should fall into a water vat and drown.

00:36:05.040 --> 00:36:06.680
Your Majesty is joking.

00:36:11.080 --> 00:36:12.240
Both ministers

00:36:12.560 --> 00:36:14.360
Have truly served with devotion

00:36:14.840 --> 00:36:16.200
And spared no effort.

00:36:17.320 --> 00:36:18.360
Keeping you in the Ministry of Rites

00:36:18.560 --> 00:36:20.080
Is truly a waste of your talents.

00:36:21.120 --> 00:36:22.400
Your Majesty flatters us.

00:36:24.400 --> 00:36:27.000
Your Majesty, the examination compound has long fallen into disrepair.

00:36:27.920 --> 00:36:29.720
We urged the Ministry of Revenue for funds many times,

00:36:30.280 --> 00:36:32.160
But the money never came.

00:36:32.240 --> 00:36:34.200
That is what caused this disaster.

00:36:34.640 --> 00:36:36.640
As Vice Minister of Rites,

00:36:36.720 --> 00:36:38.120
I accept punishment.

00:36:38.200 --> 00:36:39.400
Very well.

00:36:39.480 --> 00:36:41.440
We shall do as Minister Zhang suggests.

00:36:41.520 --> 00:36:42.560
Huang Bo,

00:36:42.680 --> 00:36:44.200
What punishment does the law prescribe?

00:36:44.280 --> 00:36:45.480
Your Majesty,

00:36:46.080 --> 00:36:47.640
Destroying special-examination papers

00:36:47.920 --> 00:36:50.440
Is punishable by thirty strokes each.

00:36:50.760 --> 00:36:52.280
Administer them yourself.

00:36:52.720 --> 00:36:54.160
Beat them here in the courtyard.

00:37:05.080 --> 00:37:05.920
Young Lady,

00:37:06.000 --> 00:37:07.080
I bought the pastries you requested.

00:37:07.400 --> 00:37:09.280
Good. Carry the rouge I bought too.

00:37:09.360 --> 00:37:10.200
Yes.

00:37:16.960 --> 00:37:17.800
After them!

00:37:18.520 --> 00:37:19.360
Hurry!

00:37:20.120 --> 00:37:21.000
Where did they go?

00:37:21.760 --> 00:37:23.640
-Search over there. -To learn how the young gentleman

00:37:23.720 --> 00:37:24.720
Solves this baffling case,

00:37:24.800 --> 00:37:26.200
Come back for the next installment!

00:37:26.440 --> 00:37:28.160
-Bravo! -Bravo!

00:37:33.440 --> 00:37:34.400
What's wrong?

00:37:34.960 --> 00:37:35.800
Everyone,

00:37:35.960 --> 00:37:37.920
I am Meng Tinghui, Provincial Laureate of Shazhou.

00:37:38.000 --> 00:37:40.000
I came to the capital for the metropolitan exam and failed,

00:37:40.080 --> 00:37:41.480
Only to discover that the policy essay

00:37:41.560 --> 00:37:42.920
Of Metropolitan Laureate An Rulan

00:37:43.160 --> 00:37:45.160
Is identical to mine, word for word.

00:37:45.720 --> 00:37:46.920
I am going to the Capital Prefecture

00:37:47.000 --> 00:37:49.320
And ask the Prefect to uncover the truth.

00:37:53.160 --> 00:37:54.800
Anyone interested

00:37:55.480 --> 00:37:57.480
May come watch the proceedings.

00:37:58.040 --> 00:37:59.360
See which Metropolitan Laureate is genuine,

00:37:59.440 --> 00:38:01.120
Meng Tinghui or An Rulan,

00:38:01.200 --> 00:38:02.520
And which is the fraud.

00:38:03.400 --> 00:38:04.720
Should villains attack me,

00:38:05.120 --> 00:38:07.120
Please lend me your righteous aid

00:38:07.280 --> 00:38:09.160
And bind them for the authorities.

00:38:09.240 --> 00:38:10.480
You will be richly rewarded.

00:38:17.200 --> 00:38:19.920
-We'll come! -We will!

00:38:20.000 --> 00:38:22.040
Boss, there are too many people. We can't make a move.

00:38:22.120 --> 00:38:22.960
Send someone to ask Second Master

00:38:23.040 --> 00:38:24.080
What to do with this woman.

00:38:26.160 --> 00:38:27.000
Who are you?

00:38:27.360 --> 00:38:28.200
Miss,

00:38:28.280 --> 00:38:29.320
We met outside the examination compound.

00:38:29.400 --> 00:38:32.000
Aren't you Grand Tutor Shen's daughter, Lord Shen's younger sister?

00:38:33.160 --> 00:38:34.520
You're the third one this month.

00:38:35.040 --> 00:38:36.320
Whatever romantic debt my brother owes you,

00:38:36.400 --> 00:38:37.880
You may collect it at our residence.

00:38:37.960 --> 00:38:39.360
Why do women keep climbing into my carriage?

00:38:39.440 --> 00:38:40.640
-Driver! -Miss Shen.

00:38:40.720 --> 00:38:42.320
I met Lord Shen in Shazhou.

00:38:42.400 --> 00:38:44.160
I came to ask him to uphold justice.

00:38:44.960 --> 00:38:45.960
Uphold justice?

00:38:48.160 --> 00:38:49.200
Where are they?

00:38:49.280 --> 00:38:50.200
-You search there. -Move!

00:38:50.280 --> 00:38:51.320
The rest of you, follow me.

00:38:53.280 --> 00:38:54.120
How can you prove

00:38:54.200 --> 00:38:55.880
That Meng Tinghui wrote the essay?

00:38:56.240 --> 00:38:57.920
How do I know you aren't framing someone?

00:38:59.000 --> 00:39:00.000
Under the Code of Great Ning,

00:39:00.120 --> 00:39:02.280
Examination fraud and identity theft

00:39:02.360 --> 00:39:03.360
Are punishable by exile of three thousand li.

00:39:03.440 --> 00:39:05.600
Falsely accusing the Metropolitan Laureate is also a grave crime.

00:39:06.720 --> 00:39:07.560
Miss Shen,

00:39:07.640 --> 00:39:08.480
I stake my life on it.

00:39:08.560 --> 00:39:09.800
Every word is true.

00:39:09.880 --> 00:39:10.720
Should I utter a single lie,

00:39:10.800 --> 00:39:11.920
You may deliver me to the authorities.

00:39:13.680 --> 00:39:14.520
Stop!

00:39:17.000 --> 00:39:18.760
Young Lady, a crowd is blocking the road.

00:39:20.800 --> 00:39:22.920
Those people outside are after you.

00:39:24.480 --> 00:39:25.320
Last night,

00:39:25.400 --> 00:39:26.760
Someone nearly murdered Meng Tinghui.

00:39:26.840 --> 00:39:27.840
We lack power and allies,

00:39:27.920 --> 00:39:28.880
So we could only make the matter public.

00:39:28.960 --> 00:39:30.360
Then these men began pursuing us.

00:39:30.960 --> 00:39:32.560
Mengmeng's fate is unknown.

00:39:32.640 --> 00:39:35.040
Miss Shen, please act honorably and save her.

00:39:36.880 --> 00:39:37.960
Someone saw them

00:39:38.040 --> 00:39:39.520
Climb into this carriage.

00:39:39.600 --> 00:39:40.480
Everyone inside the carriage,

00:39:40.560 --> 00:39:41.600
Get out!

00:39:43.800 --> 00:39:45.000
Don't worry.

00:39:49.400 --> 00:39:51.000
Blocking an official family's carriage

00:39:51.520 --> 00:39:53.560
Earns sixty strokes and one year of penal servitude.

00:39:53.920 --> 00:39:55.560
Being armed increases the sentence.

00:39:55.640 --> 00:39:57.000
Withdraw at once.

00:39:57.680 --> 00:39:59.080
So you're an official's daughter.

00:39:59.560 --> 00:40:00.480
Our apologies.

00:40:01.040 --> 00:40:02.040
We meant no offense.

00:40:02.320 --> 00:40:05.000
We're only looking for a damned girl.

00:40:06.400 --> 00:40:07.240
You...

00:40:19.960 --> 00:40:21.480
Let's see which blind fool dares.

00:40:29.760 --> 00:40:31.240
-A-Nian. -Captain Di.

00:40:31.800 --> 00:40:32.920
The Shenwei Guard is patrolling the city.

00:40:33.400 --> 00:40:34.840
You have gathered a mob,

00:40:34.920 --> 00:40:36.360
And harassed civilians.

00:40:36.840 --> 00:40:37.760
-Arrest them all! -Yes!

00:40:38.280 --> 00:40:39.440
Brothers, retreat!

00:40:41.080 --> 00:40:42.040
Stop!

00:40:50.680 --> 00:40:51.560
Sister Zhili.

00:40:52.040 --> 00:40:54.280
-Were you frightened? -I'm fine.

00:40:55.840 --> 00:40:56.680
Sister Zhili,

00:40:57.000 --> 00:40:57.880
Let me escort you home.

00:40:58.440 --> 00:40:59.920
Where is His Majesty now?

00:41:07.640 --> 00:41:08.640
I just...

00:41:08.880 --> 00:41:10.120
Did you lose count?

00:41:11.800 --> 00:41:13.040
You can't even count properly?

00:41:13.600 --> 00:41:14.520
Your Majesty, please understand.

00:41:14.600 --> 00:41:16.080
I felt sorry for the two ministers

00:41:16.240 --> 00:41:18.200
And went soft, so I lost count.

00:41:18.760 --> 00:41:20.040
Since you can't count,

00:41:21.160 --> 00:41:22.240
Start the beating again from the beginning.

00:41:23.240 --> 00:41:24.640
Please don't!

00:41:24.720 --> 00:41:27.400
Ten... fifteen.

00:41:27.480 --> 00:41:29.320
You remember it very clearly.

00:41:29.920 --> 00:41:31.320
It seems the blows still aren't hard enough.

00:41:31.400 --> 00:41:32.360
Huang Bo.

00:41:32.760 --> 00:41:33.920
Continue.

00:41:37.840 --> 00:41:39.960
One hundred candidates passed this metropolitan examination.

00:41:40.400 --> 00:41:41.960
Yet Meng Tinghui, Shazhou's Provincial Laureate,

00:41:42.040 --> 00:41:43.120
Failed.

00:41:43.440 --> 00:41:44.920
I found that suspicious.

00:41:45.000 --> 00:41:46.760
I wasn't certain before,

00:41:46.920 --> 00:41:48.840
But now the papers have been destroyed one after another.

00:41:48.920 --> 00:41:49.880
Tell me,

00:41:50.480 --> 00:41:52.080
Is that merely coincidence?

00:41:52.840 --> 00:41:55.480
I truly don't know, Your Majesty.

00:41:55.560 --> 00:41:57.360
Then find someone who does.

00:41:57.440 --> 00:41:59.240
Summon every proctor,

00:41:59.320 --> 00:42:01.520
Copyist, sealing clerk, and examiner from this year's examination.

00:42:02.080 --> 00:42:03.840
Investigating them will take time.

00:42:04.400 --> 00:42:05.240
Perhaps

00:42:07.000 --> 00:42:08.680
We should give him thirty strokes first.

00:42:12.080 --> 00:42:13.160
I'll confess!

00:42:14.080 --> 00:42:15.440
I'm willing to confess!

00:42:16.840 --> 00:42:17.800
The examination was rigged!

00:42:17.880 --> 00:42:19.080
There was no fairness!

00:42:19.160 --> 00:42:20.720
Everyone, come and see!

00:42:21.440 --> 00:42:22.280
How could such a thing happen?

00:42:22.360 --> 00:42:23.280
Fraud in the special examination!

00:42:23.600 --> 00:42:25.400
There's a spectacle. Let's go!

00:42:26.040 --> 00:42:27.280
Scholar Meng Tinghui,

00:42:27.880 --> 00:42:28.920
Provincial Laureate of Shazhou,

00:42:29.920 --> 00:42:32.200
Had her policy essay stolen by An Rulan,

00:42:32.280 --> 00:42:34.440
And is going to the Capital Prefecture to seek justice.

00:42:34.520 --> 00:42:36.720
She will expose the truth of the examination fraud

00:42:36.800 --> 00:42:38.920
And restore fairness to the metropolitan examination.

00:42:39.200 --> 00:42:40.200
It's Meng Tinghui.

00:42:40.720 --> 00:42:42.240
Come on. Follow her to the Capital Prefecture.

00:42:42.320 --> 00:42:44.080
Everyone, let's go together!

00:42:44.160 --> 00:42:45.480
Demand justice!

00:42:45.560 --> 00:42:48.040
-Demand justice! -Demand justice!

00:42:50.440 --> 00:42:51.600
Scholar Meng Tinghui

00:42:51.840 --> 00:42:53.680
Accuses Metropolitan Laureate An Rulan

00:42:53.880 --> 00:42:55.360
Of stealing her policy essay.

00:42:55.440 --> 00:42:56.640
Prefect, please uphold justice.

00:42:57.120 --> 00:42:58.240
The Master said,

00:42:58.720 --> 00:43:00.240
'Think thrice before acting.'

00:43:00.680 --> 00:43:02.560
Twice is enough.

00:43:03.360 --> 00:43:05.840
You spread this article throughout the capital

00:43:05.920 --> 00:43:07.360
And caused an uproar.

00:43:07.440 --> 00:43:08.800
Do you have evidence?

00:43:08.880 --> 00:43:10.240
Prefect, summon An Rulan

00:43:10.640 --> 00:43:11.680
And let us confront each other in court.

00:43:12.240 --> 00:43:13.080
Prefect,

00:43:13.720 --> 00:43:16.320
She gathered all those people outside.

00:43:18.720 --> 00:43:20.040
Summon Metropolitan Laureate An.

00:43:20.364 --> 00:43:22.364
MkvDrama.Net

